 X was the subject of the world's most effective political slogan: \"X, X, Milk _______.\"\nAs Education Secretary in 1970, X ended free milk for schoolchildren over the age of seven. This nickname followed X for 40 years, becoming a shorthand in pop culture for X’s perceived \"lack of compassion,\" even though the policy actually started under the previous Labour government's budget cuts. Id X and bonus points for the slogan.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:03:05Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Thatcher", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:03:07Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "thacther", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:03:08Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "margaret", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:03:22Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Labour isn't working.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:03:28Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Snatcher", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:03:29Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "thatcher thatcher, milk snatcher", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:04:29Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Bas neeche ki do line padhi. 🤦🏾‍♂️", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-08T18:04:32Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Margaret Thatcher the milk snatcher  is correct, passed away on this day in 2013", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]